{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\windows\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\powershell.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 tools/native/prepare-headless.ps1; Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 tools/native/NativePreviewCacheProbe.java; rg -n 'P4-19|C-4|NATIVE_TARGET' '遗留目标与未完成事项.md' '基于graalvm的MHT资源提取器项目打包工作流程.md' 'UI可切换重构方案.md'; rg -n 'ExtractWarning' tools/native/headless/reachability-metadata.json src/main/resources/META-INF/native-image/com.mhtextractor/reachability-metadata.json; Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 CLAUDE.md | Select-Object -Skip 223 -First 42\"","aggregated_output":"# Input assembly only. The native-image invocation lives in build-native.cmd.\r\nparam(\r\n    [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$Repo,\r\n    [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$WorkDir,\r\n    [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$OutputDir,\r\n    [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$JavaHome,\r\n    [string]$DefaultCharset\r\n)\r\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\r\nAdd-Type -AssemblyName System.IO.Compression.FileSystem\r\n$utf8 = New-Object System.Text.UTF8Encoding($false)\r\n$root = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($WorkDir).TrimEnd('\\')\r\nif (-not $root.StartsWith('H:\\TEST\\mht\\', [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)) {\r\n    throw 'Headless work directory must be under H:\\TEST\\mht\\.'\r\n}\r\n$dist = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($OutputDir).TrimEnd('\\')\r\nif (-not $dist.StartsWith('H:\\TEST\\mht\\', [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)) {\r\n    throw 'Headless dist must be under H:\\TEST\\mht\\.'\r\n}\r\nforeach ($dir in @($root,$dist)) {\r\n    if ((Test-Path -LiteralPath $dir) -and\r\n        ((Get-Item -LiteralPath $dir).Attributes -band [IO.FileAttributes]::ReparsePoint)) {\r\n        throw \"Headless work/dist must be physical H-drive directories: $dir\"\r\n    }\r\n}\r\nif (Test-Path -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dist 'MhtExtractor.exe')) {\r\n    throw 'Refusing to use a GUI dist for the headless target.'\r\n}\r\n# Reports/metadata must belong to this build, never an older native-image run.\r\nforeach ($name in @('reports','metadata')) {\r\n    $old = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath((Join-Path $dist $name))\r\n    if (-not $old.StartsWith($dist + '\\', [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)) {\r\n        throw 'Unsafe headless artifact subdirectory.'\r\n    }\r\n    if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $old) {\r\n        if ((Get-Item -LiteralPath $old).Attributes -band [IO.FileAttributes]::ReparsePoint) {\r\n            throw \"Refusing to delete a reparse point: $old\"\r\n        }\r\n        Remove-Item -LiteralPath $old -Recurse -Force\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n# Delete only our named input directory after verifying its absolute boundary.\r\n$inputDir = Join-Path $root 'input'\r\nif (-not ([IO.Path]::GetFullPath($inputDir)).StartsWith($root + '\\', [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)) {\r\n    throw 'Unsafe headless input directory.'\r\n}\r\nif (Test-Path -LiteralPath $inputDir) {\r\n    if ((Get-Item -LiteralPath $inputDir).Attributes -band [IO.FileAttributes]::ReparsePoint) {\r\n        throw \"Refusing to delete a reparse point: $inputDir\"\r\n    }\r\n    Remove-Item -LiteralPath $inputDir -Recurse -Force\r\n}\r\n$classes = Join-Path $inputDir 'classes'\r\n$libs = Join-Path $inputDir 'lib'\r\n$metadata = Join-Path $inputDir 'metadata'\r\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $classes,$libs,$metadata -Force | Out-Null\r\n$packages = @('app','backend','cache','config','core','extractor','i18n','model',\r\n    'output','platform','processor','uicore','uiport','util')\r\n$classCount = 0\r\nforeach ($package in $packages) {\r\n    $source = Join-Path $Repo ('target\\classes\\com\\mhtextractor\\' + $package)\r\n    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $source)) { throw \"Missing compiled package: $source\" }\r\n    foreach ($file in Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $source -Filter '*.class' -Recurse -File) {\r\n        $bytes = [IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($file.FullName)\r\n        if ([Text.Encoding]::GetEncoding(28591).GetString($bytes) -match 'javafx[./]') {\r\n            throw \"JavaFX reference in headless class: $($file.FullName)\"\r\n        }\r\n        $relative = $file.FullName.Substring((Join-Path $Repo 'target\\classes').Length + 1)\r\n        $dest = Join-Path $classes $relative\r\n        New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path ([IO.Path]::GetDirectoryName($dest)) -Force | Out-Null\r\n        Copy-Item -LiteralPath $file.FullName -Destination $dest\r\n        $classCount++\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n# Business locale resources, headless logging and the compile-time handshake identity.\r\nCopy-Item -LiteralPath (Join-Path $Repo 'target\\classes\\i18n') -Destination $classes -Recurse\r\nCopy-Item -LiteralPath (Join-Path $Repo 'target\\classes\\logback-headless.xml') -Destination $classes\r\nCopy-Item -LiteralPath (Join-Path $Repo 'target\\classes\\backend-build.properties') -Destination $classes\r\n$jar = Join-Path $inputDir 'backend.jar'\r\n& (Join-Path $JavaHome 'bin\\jar.exe') --create --file $jar --main-class com.mhtextractor.backend.BackendCli -C $classes .\r\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"jar failed: $LASTEXITCODE\" }\r\n# Copy runtime jars, excluding all UI libraries. No shaded GUI jar on this classpath.\r\n$dependencies = @(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath (Join-Path $Repo 'target\\lib') -Filter '*.jar' -File |\r\n    Where-Object { $_.Name -notmatch '^(javafx-|atlantafx-|ikonli-)' } | Sort-Object Name)\r\nif ($dependencies.Count -eq 0) { throw 'Missing runtime dependencies; run Maven package.' }\r\nforeach ($dep in $dependencies) {\r\n    $dest = Join-Path $libs $dep.Name\r\n    Copy-Item -LiteralPath $dep.FullName -Destination $dest\r\n    # webp ships two optional FX adapters and a module descriptor referencing FX.\r\n    # Keep its pure Java decoder; trim only the isolated build-input copy.\r\n    if ($dep.Name -like 'webp-*.jar') {\r\n        $archive = [IO.Compression.ZipFile]::Open($dest, [IO.Compression.ZipArchiveMode]::Update)\r\n        try {\r\n            foreach ($entry in @($archive.Entries)) {\r\n                if ($entry.FullName -match '^org/glavo/webp/javafx/' -or $entry.FullName -eq 'module-info.class') {\r\n                    $entry.Delete()\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        } finally { $archive.Dispose() }\r\n    }\r\n    $archive = [IO.Compression.ZipFile]::OpenRead($dest)\r\n    try {\r\n        foreach ($entry in $archive.Entries) {\r\n            if ($entry.FullName -match '(^|/)(javafx/|com/sun/javafx/)|META-INF/native-image/') {\r\n                throw \"Unexpected UI class or automatic native metadata in dependency: $($dep.Name):$($entry.FullName)\"\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    } finally { $archive.Dispose() }\r\n}\r\n$subset = Join-Path $Repo 'tools\\native\\headless'\r\nforeach ($file in Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $subset -File) {\r\n    if ($file.Extension -in @('.json','.properties')) {\r\n        Copy-Item -LiteralPath $file.FullName -Destination $metadata\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n& (Join-Path $Repo 'tools\\native\\assert-headless-metadata.ps1') -MetadataDir $metadata\r\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw 'Headless metadata assertion failed.' }\r\n$cp = (@($jar) + @($dependencies | ForEach-Object { Join-Path $libs $_.Name })) -join ';'\r\n[IO.File]::WriteAllText((Join-Path $inputDir 'classpath.txt'), $cp, $utf8)\r\n# Windows CRT argv is encoded using the system ANSI codepage. Graal's default\r\n# UTF-8 image charset corrupts non-ASCII CLI arguments on a CP936 host.\r\nif (-not $DefaultCharset) {\r\n    $encoding = [Text.Encoding]::Default\r\n    $DefaultCharset = switch ($encoding.CodePage) {\r\n        936 { 'GBK' }\r\n        932 { 'windows-31j' }\r\n        950 { 'x-windows-950' }\r\n        949 { 'x-windows-949' }\r\n        default { $encoding.WebName }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n[IO.File]::WriteAllText((Join-Path $inputDir 'default-charset.txt'), $DefaultCharset, $utf8)\r\n$manifest = @(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $inputDir -Recurse -File | Where-Object Name -ne 'manifest.tsv' |\r\n    Sort-Object FullName | ForEach-Object {\r\n        \"{0}`t{1}`t{2}\" -f $_.FullName.Substring($inputDir.Length + 1), $_.Length,\r\n            (Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $_.FullName -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToLower()\r\n    })\r\n[IO.File]::WriteAllLines((Join-Path $inputDir 'manifest.tsv'), [string[]]$manifest, $utf8)\r\n\"[headless] input: $classCount classes / $($dependencies.Count) runtime jars / no GUI jar or automatic metadata\"\r\n\"[headless] classpath: $cp\"\r\n\"[headless] explicit metadata: $metadata\"\r\n\"[headless] Windows argument charset: $DefaultCharset\"\r\nimport com.mhtextractor.cache.PreviewCacheKey;\r\nimport com.mhtextractor.cache.PreviewCacheMeta;\r\nimport com.mhtextractor.cache.PreviewCacheStore;\r\n\r\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\r\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\r\nimport java.util.List;\r\nimport java.util.Map;\r\n\r\n/** Native regression for Jackson's reflective array allocation, including empty images. */\r\npublic final class NativePreviewCacheProbe {\r\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\r\n        if (args.length != 2 || !(args[1].equals(\"empty\") || args[1].equals(\"nonempty\"))) {\r\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Usage: NativePreviewCacheProbe <fixture-root> empty|nonempty\");\r\n        }\r\n        Path fixture = Path.of(args[0]).toAbsolutePath().normalize();\r\n        var key = PreviewCacheKey.compute(fixture.resolve(\"source.mht\"), \"p4-19\",\r\n                PreviewCacheMeta.FORMAT_VERSION);\r\n        var store = new PreviewCacheStore(fixture.resolve(\"cache\"));\r\n        System.out.println(\"[probe] load=\" + store.dirFor(key).resolve(\"meta.json\"));\r\n        var meta = store.load(key).orElseThrow(() -> new AssertionError(\"cache miss\"));\r\n        int expectedCount = args[1].equals(\"empty\") ? 0 : 1;\r\n        if (meta.images().size() != expectedCount || !meta.imageMode()) {\r\n            throw new AssertionError(\"image metadata differs\");\r\n        }\r\n        if (meta.warnings().size() != 1\r\n                || !meta.warnings().getFirst().key().equals(\"extract.region.r2\")\r\n                || !meta.warnings().getFirst().args().equals(Map.of(\"start\", \"123\", \"end\", \"123\"))) {\r\n            throw new AssertionError(\"structured warning differs\");\r\n        }\r\n        if (expectedCount > 0) {\r\n            var image = meta.images().getFirst();\r\n            if (!image.file().equals(\"images/0001.png\") || !image.sourceId().equals(\"cid:p4-19\")\r\n                    || !image.originalName().equals(\"fixture.png\") || !image.detectedExt().equals(\"png\")\r\n                    || !image.warnings().equals(meta.warnings())\r\n                    || Files.size(store.imageFileFor(meta, 0)) == 0) {\r\n                throw new AssertionError(\"image or its warning differs\");\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        if (!store.listKeys().equals(List.of(key))) throw new AssertionError(\"listKeys differs\");\r\n        System.out.println(\"[PASS] native load/listKeys images=\" + expectedCount + \" warnings=1\");\r\n        // Serialize the same shape back: the app's rebuild path writes the cache BEFORE any read.\r\n        if (expectedCount == 0) {\r\n            var writeRoot = Files.createTempDirectory(\"p4-19-native-write\");\r\n            var writeStore = new PreviewCacheStore(writeRoot);\r\n            writeStore.write(key, meta, dir -> { });\r\n            if (writeStore.load(key).isEmpty()) throw new AssertionError(\"write/load round-trip missed\");\r\n            System.out.println(\"[PASS] native write/load round-trip images=0\");\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\nUI可切换重构方案.md:384:| 6 | 台账 3 / 历史文档纪律：两份元数据并存、**不可直接删 `reflect-config.json`**（同 type 取并集） | P4 纪律：**只新增\"后端子集\"，绝不删/改旧文件**（见冲突 C-4） |\nUI可切换重构方案.md:399:| **C-4** | 元数据能否为无头构建去掉 javafx 条目 | \"不可直接删 `reflect-config.json`，同 type 取并集\" | P4 需要\"无头构建不含 JavaFX 元数据\" | ①新增\"后端子集\"文件 + 构建参数指定，旧文件一字不动；②裁剪旧文件（危险） | **①**；并新增一条验证：若 GraalVM 对\"指向不存在类的条目\"报错，则用\"后端子集独立目录\"隔离，而非删条目 |\nUI可切换重构方案.md:409:**全部 16 个决策点已于 2026-10-05 定稿**（逐条见 §14）。本节 7 项冲突的处置：C-1 选\"一次性上调配额并记账\"；C-2 选\"以职责为判据\"；C-3 选\"推迟到 P3 之后\"；C-4 按\"只新增后端子集\"执行（无争议）；C-5 选\"只承诺新 UI 版\"；C-6 按\"端口层不得引用 I18n\"执行（无争议）；C-7 选\"列入正式文档集 + 纳入提交\"。\n基于graalvm的MHT资源提取器项目打包工作流程.md:2444:先用 `NATIVE_TARGET=headless` 构建 `MhtExtractorBackend.exe`，再构建 JavaFX 发行目录。\r\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:65:> - ✅ **P4-3 完成并验收**（2026-10-08，提交 `d36988d`，9 文件 +1017）：`build-native.cmd` 新增 **`NATIVE_TARGET=headless`**（沿用同一实现，不另造平行构建）；新增 `tools/native/prepare-headless.ps1`（后端子集准备）、`tools/native/assert-headless-metadata.ps1`（**构建层断言**，不满足即非零退出）、`tools/native/headless/reachability-metadata.json`（后端子集）；`ArchitectureTest` 新增**第 17 条不变式** `headlessNativeMetadataHasNoJavaFx`。\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:66:>   - **harness 独立验收（原始数字）**：compile 0；**933/0/0** + headless **73/0**（`MVN_EXIT=0`）；`ArchitectureTest` **17/0**（第 17 条运行并绿：`headless native metadata: 1 files / 0 JavaFX entries`）；**既有七份元数据 `git diff` = 空（C-4 红线守住）**；产物基线 42/0；**GUI zh/en 34/0**；**14 探针全绿**；**C 盘零新增**。\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:965:## 15. P4-19（native 元数据缺口）验收与收尾（2026-10-10，harness 接手完成）\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:967:**批次** P4-19 · 模型 `gpt-6.1-sol` · effort **xhigh** · detach **496.6 s 后 `quota-blocked`**（7d 额度近上限）；**harness 接手完成**（补 write 路径、修冒烟、跑红/绿、完整 native 构建、门禁、提交）。提交 **`36e20c9`**。\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:978:- 🚨 **关键教训**：只调 `load` 的探针**修复前也通过** —— 该缺口只由**序列化（write）**触发；控制组必须覆盖 `write`，否则是假红/假绿。（P4-19 首版探针就因此没复现。）\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:1015:### 18.3 🚩 P5a-0 发现的**既有** native 缺口（P4-19 同族，建议尽快单独立批）\n遗留目标与未完成事项.md:1038:  **C-4 红线**（既有七份元数据一字不动）；不许改生产代码；必须做**红/绿控制组**（修复前元数据跑出**逐字一致**的 `ExtractWarning.key()` 报错 = 红；\nsrc/main/resources/META-INF/native-image/com.mhtextractor/reachability-metadata.json:3313:   \"type\": \"com.mhtextractor.model.ExtractWarning\",\nsrc/main/resources/META-INF/native-image/com.mhtextractor/reachability-metadata.json:3333:   \"type\": \"com.mhtextractor.model.ExtractWarning[]\"\ntools/native/headless/reachability-metadata.json:515:      \"type\": \"com.mhtextractor.model.ExtractWarning\"\ntools/native/headless/reachability-metadata.json:518:      \"type\": \"com.mhtextractor.model.ExtractWarning[]\"\n- **`logs/gui-state.json` 的 `locale` 覆盖 `-Duser.language`**；**`logs/test-results.txt` 必须核对 mtime**。\r\n- 🚨 **本机 UAC 关闭（`EnableLUA=0`）**：会话全为高完整性 ⇒ Windows **静默阻断 UWP 的\"文件激活\"**\r\n  （进程起来但无窗口、**退出码仍 0**，资源管理器里双击图片也打不开）。凡\"用系统默认程序打开文件\"一律走 `platform.FileOpener`。\r\n- 🚨 **运行时/测试产物一律放 H 盘（2026-10-05 起）**：本项目产物放 `H:\\TEST\\mht\\`、临时放 `H:\\TEST\\temp\\`；跑 GUI / native / 探针 / 黑盒前设 **`-Djava.io.tmpdir=H:\\TEST\\temp`**（否则预览缓存 `mht-extractor-preview`、浏览器查看页 `mht-extractor-view` 会写进 `C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp`）。**不要再把生成数据塞到 C 盘**，验收时断言 C 盘无新增生成数据。宿主目录 `.dsh` / `.agents-anywhere` / `.m2` / `.openjfx` 已是指向 `H:\\TEST\\*` 的 **junction**（旧 C 路径仍可用，新脚本请用 H 路径）；详见 `H:\\TEST\\MIGRATION-BRIEF.md`。\r\n- **任何 `mvn clean` 不得与 GUI 自动化 / native 构建并发**（会互删 `target/`）。\r\n- **不要整文件读取 `MainController.java`**（1654 行）：`grep -n` 定位 + 区间读。\r\n  **文档里的行号会漂移**，引用前先复核。\r\n- **git 身份未配置**：提交需内联 `git -c user.name=… -c user.email=… commit`（不要改用户环境）。\r\n- `.gitignore` 的 `/config/`、`/logs/`、`/temp/`、`/输出文件/` 已锚定仓库根，**不要去掉前导 `/`**\r\n  （否则会误伤 `src/test/java/com/mhtextractor/config/`，新测试文件被静默忽略）。\r\n- `.claude-work/` 是**本地草稿区（gitignored、不随仓库分发）**；`tools/` 才是分发件 —— 两者不要混。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 6. 验证纪律（本项目最重要的工程约定）\r\n\r\n**执行方（人或 agent）的自述不能作为验收依据。** 每条结论都要用**不同手段**独立复验。已验证有效的手段：\r\n\r\n| 手段 | 曾发现的问题 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 直接聚合 `target/surefire-reports/*.txt` 算测试数（不读执行方日志） | 多次校正基线 |\r\n| 独立 diff / SHA-256 比对（含 `git diff --no-index`） | 证明行为无字节偏差 |\r\n| 自写探针直连生产路径 | 证明缓存 schema 与命中判定正确 |\r\n| 方法/字段级存量对账（元数据修改前后） | 证明去重没丢条目 |\r\n| 字节码常量池扫描（而非 grep import） | 发现全限定名引用可绕过 import 扫描 |\r\n| 跑 GUI 前先删结果文件、跑完核对 **mtime** | 被\"上一次的 34/0\"骗过一次 |\r\n| 给强断言配**控制组** | 发现两条断言是假通过 |\r\n| **会自己消失的 UI**：同帧断言或用闸门卡住后台任务 | 曾把正确实现误判成 FAIL |\r\n\r\n**native 卡片冒烟：三处叠加缺陷全部已修（2026-10-08，`d9e0c7f` + `351f6de`）——「static 冒烟一律挂死」的旧说法作废**\r\n\r\n① **脚本读/超时缺陷（已修，P4-7 `d9e0c7f`）**：旧 `native-card-smoke.ps1` 用顺序 `StandardOutput.ReadToEnd()` + `StandardError.ReadToEnd()` 再 `WaitForExit(timeout)` → **经典 stdio 死锁**，`-TimeoutSec` 对读管道**无效**，现象是 `[smoke] running probe ...` 后长时间零输出（曾挂 16 分钟）。**修法**：两路输出**重定向到文件**、立即限时等待、超时 `taskkill /PID … /T /F` + 返回 1、退出码用 Win32 `GetExitCodeProcess` 读取（本机 `$proc.ExitCode` 恒为空）。**harness 实测**：修后 static 冒烟 **30 s 内返回 exit=1**（不再假挂）。\r\n\r\n② **`-OutDir` 从不清 DLL（已修 P4-8）**：冒烟脚本把 `-JfxDlls\\*.dll` 拷进 `-OutDir`，但**从不清理 `-OutDir` 里已有的 DLL**；而 `build-native.cmd` 集成调用固定用持久目录 `.claude-work\\native-card-smoke`。→ **dynamic 冒烟跑过之后再来 static**，残留的 7 个 JavaFX DLL 被加载 → `WinApplication._init` **段错误**（`0xC0000005`，`SegfaultHandler`） → **static 端到端 `build-native.cmd` FAILED（退出码 1）**。harness 已复现（`smoke-output.log.err` 里有段错误栈），且**实施方只在干净目录下验过**，其「static 通过」不覆盖集成路径。**已修（P4-8）**：构建前清 `-OutDir` 的 `*.dll`，再由 native-image 重新生成（`-SkipNativeBuild` 语义保留；harness 用**哨兵 DLL** 验证清理确实执行）。⚠️ **但它单独不够** —— 见 ③。\r\n\r\n③ **真根因（P4-9 `351f6de`，已修并由 harness 复验）**：`build-native.cmd:236` 执行 `set \"PATH=%BUILD_JAVA_HOME%\\bin;%PATH%\"`，而 **NIK JDK 的 `bin` 里含全部 7 个 JavaFX 原生 DLL**（`glass`/`prism_common`/`prism_d3d`/`prism_sw`/`decora_sse`/`javafx_font`/`javafx_iio`）→ **static 镜像运行时从 PATH 命中它们** → 与静态链接的 JavaFX 冲突 → `WinApplication._init` **段错误 `0xC0000005`** → `[smoke] FAILED` → static 集成构建 `exit 1`。**控制组**：只给 standalone 命令前置同一行 PATH，即**从 PASS 变 FAIL**。**修法**：static 配方的冒烟**子进程**重建 PATH 并剔除 `BUILD_JAVA_HOME\\bin`/`GRAALVM_HOME\\bin`（**dynamic 原样保留**，它本来就依赖这些 DLL）；顺带把误导性的 `Usual cause: missing JavaFX effect-peer reflection metadata` 改成指向 `smoke-output.log/.err`。**harness 复验**：集成 static 带冒烟 → `exit 0` + `[STEP SMOKE] END exit=0` + `[smoke] RESULTS: 5 passed, 0 failed`；集成 dynamic → `exit 0`、dist 22 文件/71.8 MB。\r\n\r\n另：`NativeBaselineProbe` 的工作根必须用**仓库内相对路径**（绝对 `H:\\...` 会 `AccessDeniedException`）；且**两个配方共用同一 dist 目录**——`NATIVE_RECIPE` 漏设或 dist 未清空都会让产物计数被污染。\r\n\r\n**2026-10-08 收口轮（P4-10/11/12，提交 `a268a7b`）——四条口径与两条重要事实**\r\n\r\n1. 🚨 **`testAccessSurfaceIsFrozen` 的扫描范围包含 `tools/probes/*.java`**：在**探针**里加反射（如 `getDeclaredField`/`setAccessible`）同样会算成**清单外新增访问点**而变红（P4-12 实测：ESC 观测曾因此把第 13 条打红）。→ **探针里尽量只用公开 API**；真需要动态访问就必须进冻结清单（且清单**只减不增**，得先去掉别的条）。\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
